BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:10% Off: “Tapas Tuesdays” in Union Square
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638256@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBota Tapas & Paella Bar near D
 owntown San Francisco and Union Square is doing “Tapas Tuesdays” and e
 njoy all of our delicious Spanish Tapas at 10% Off. Just mention “Tapas 
 Tuesday” to our server before ordering to get the discount.\nAbout Bota 
 Tapas and Paella Bar\n\nAs an age-old tradition dating back to the early 1
 800s\, Spanish travelers used “BOTA”\, or traditional sheep-skinned re
 positories\, to transport and share their wine. The Spaniards historically
  thrived on the values of sharing and community: two ideals that have buoy
 antly withstood the test of time. Tailored around these same ideals are Sp
 ain’s cuisine and the development of “tapas\,” style dining – wher
 e individuals share small plates and memories. From Seville to San Francis
 co\, and across the world\, our goal is to initiate more memories – this
  is why and how we operate. Whether it be with your friends or family\, we
  here at Bota sincerely hope that you enjoy this stop on your journey.\n\n
 Free\n\nTickets: https://www.botasf.com/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com
 /10-tapas-tuesdays-union-square-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_51
 18.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Bota Tapas and Paella Bar\, 490 Geary Street\, San Francisco\, CA
  94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/10-tapas-tuesdays-union-square-sf/
END:VEVENT
