BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Art Exhibition (SF Disability Cultural Center)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T180000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1640045@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerIs art political? Of course\, 
 it is! From the brush strokes to the paint colors to the pen nib\, everyth
 ing is political! The real question is\, are you courageous enough to foll
 ow these stories? You may not share their world view\, but have you ever w
 ondered what the world on the other side of your bubble believes in? This 
 showcase highlights Queer tales that are often hidden from our platforms. 
 They don’t fit these neat boxes. But they exist. Join me as I revisit th
 ese tales\, actively dissent from the dominant narrative & engage with hum
 ans from across the spectrum.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://dcc.page/art-tal
 k\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/queer-art-exhibition-sf-disability-cul
 tural-center/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_20
 260930_140138.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:SF Disability Cultural Center\, 165 Grove St\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/queer-art-exhibition-sf-disability-cultural-ce
 nter/
END:VEVENT
