DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerAfter Life Presents: HOWL! A H
 alloween Kick-Off – bring your primal self to the dance floor\, all mons
 ters are welcome. Treats for those in costume!\nDark Techno + Darkwave + I
 ndustrial Bass + Witch HouseSAT\, OCT 3RD / 2 ROOMS / 5 DJSNO PHONES ON TH
 E DANCE FLOOR\nABOVE:Sage + Starr Noir + Melting GirlDAZZLE:Malvirus + Ali
 ce Stribling\nAfter Life is a night dedicated to the heavier\, darker side
  of Electronica\, with a focus on bringing new music to the front. This is
  not a goth party\, this is a Dark Electronica Experience. Hear anywhere f
 rom Dark Techno to Darkwave. Industrial Bass to Witch House. Featuring DJs
  that bring enthusiasm and talent with their mixing skills\, curating a se
 amless dancefloor experience to take you to the underworld. Whether you’
 re a Rivethead\, Graver or dark Electronica Aficionado\, we welcome you to
  the After Life.\nAfter Life is an inclusive space\, zero tolerance for bi
 gotry\, racism or fascism of any kind. Please\, no phones on the dance flo
 or.\n\n$10.00\n\nTickets: https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/2026/10-03d.h
 tml\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/halloween-kickoff-dark-techno-witch-
 house-dna-lounge/\nSource: Funcheap SF
