DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBeer meets science at Tech at 
 Nite: Geektoberfest\, an adults-only night of brews\, beats\, experiments\
 , and after-hours exploration at The Tech Interactive.\nOn Thursday\, Oct.
  8\, from 7 to 11 p.m.\, discover the art and science behind your favorite
  pour with tastings from local breweries\, hands-on activities\, and conve
 rsations with the people who know beer best. Then grab a drink\, catch a D
 J set\, explore The Tech’s exhibits after dark\, and discover a differen
 t side of downtown San Jose nightlife.\n\nWhat to Expect\nGeek out over fe
 rmentation\, flavor\, and the science inside your glass. Your night includ
 es:\n– Beer tastings from local breweries including Fox Tale Fermentatio
 n Project\, Clandestine Brewing\, Hapas Brewing Company\, DTSJ Brewing Co.
 \, Fathers Brewing\, and more\n– Beer Spherification Lab led by The Tech
  Interactive staff\n– Science of Beer demonstrations and talks with brew
 ers\n– Music and sounds curated by Universal Grammar’s Zuri Alexa\n–
  An Innovator Vendor Market featuring South Bay makers and artisans\n– F
 ull access to The Tech Interactive’s hands-on exhibits and workshops\nWh
 ether you’re a beer nerd\, science geek\, curious tinkerer\, or just loo
 king for something different to do with friends\, Geektoberfest is an invi
 tation to sip\, experiment\, explore\, and play.\nGeneral Admission: $30 e
 arly bird\nEarly bird pricing increases to $35 at sellout. Admission inclu
 des gallery exhibits\, workshops\, the bar\, and beer tastings. General Ad
 mission does not inc...\n\n$30.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/event
 s/163494/t/tickets\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/geektoberfest-beer-ta
 stings-science-dark-san-jose/\nSource: Funcheap SF
