 d-17.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The Tech Interactive\, 201 S. Market St.  San Jose\, CA 95113
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/geektoberfest-beer-tastings-science-dark-san-j
 ose/
