  Cyndi Lauper\, When in Rome\, Eurythmics\, Blondie\, David Bowie\, Kim Wi
 lde\, Depeche Mode\, The Cure\, Q Lazzarus\, Men without Hats & more.\n\n2
  dance floors\, 2 bars\, 1 coat check.\n\nOpen at 9pm\, $10 before 10pm an
 d $15 after.\n\n1190 Folsom near 8th in SF CA\, 21+ w/ID.\n\nWe are perfec
 t for hosting Birthdays & big groups.\n\nGet tickets today & let’s dance
 .\n\nAdvance tickets online:\n\nTICKETS\n\n$10\n\nTickets: https://summerd
