UID:funcheap-1638264@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBota Tapas & Paella BarBota Ta
 pas & Paella Bar near Downtown San Francisco and Union Square is doing “
 Tapas Tuesdays” and enjoy all of our delicious Spanish Tapas at 10% Off.
  Just mention “Tapas Tuesday” to our server before ordering to get the
  discount.\nAbout Bota Tapas and Paella Bar\n\nAs an age-old tradition dat
 ing back to the early 1800s\, Spanish travelers used “BOTA”\, or tradi
 tional sheep-skinned repositories\, to transport and share their wine. The
  Spaniards historically thrived on the values of sharing and community: tw
 o ideals that have buoyantly withstood the test of time. Tailored around t
 hese same ideals are Spain’s cuisine and the development of “tapas\,
 ” style dining – where individuals share small plates and memories. Fr
 om Seville to San Francisco\, and across the world\, our goal is to initia
 te more memories – this is why and how we operate. Whether it be with yo
 ur friends or family\, we here at Bota sincerely hope that you enjoy this 
 stop on your journey.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.botasf.com/\nDetails
 : https://sf.funcheap.com/tapas-tuesday-10-spanish-tapas/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Pulpo.
 webp
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Bota Tapas & Paella Bar\, 490 Geary Street\, San Francisco\, CA 9
 4102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/tapas-tuesday-10-spanish-tapas/
END:VEVENT
