BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Here-ish & Queer-ish: Stories of Queer Jewish California
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17906165@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:Join the JCCSF\, Keshet\, Nice Jewish Boys+\, and Sapphic Jewi
 sh Social Club for a joyful evening of creativity\, and connection. Come f
 or Shabbat\, stay for stories\, laughter\, and live performances celebrati
 ng Queer Jewish life right here in California.\nFor generations\, Californ
 ia\, and the Bay Area especially\, has been a place to land when you neede
 d somewhere to seek refuge\, find your people\, reinvent yourself\, and bu
 ild something entirely your own. Together\, we’ll explore that legacy an
 d what it really means to find Queer Jewish belonging here today.\nWe’ll
  welcome Shabbat with candles glowing\, wine poured\, and challah shared\,
  before settling in for featured performers and then opening the mic to yo
 u. Poetry\, music\, comedy\, a story that’s been sitting in your heart f
 or years\, whatever you’ve got\, we want to hear it. Or come as you are\
 , grab a chair\, and just listen.\nWhether you come to perform\, meet new 
 people\, celebrate Shabbat\, or simply experience a night of Queer Jewish 
 joy\, there’s a place for you here.\nInterested in taking the mic?\nAfte
 r you register\, keep an eye out for your confirmation email\, it’ll inc
 lude a form where you can sign up to perform at the open mic. We’ll foll
 ow up to confirm participation!\nQuestions about the open mic? Email Loren
 n Kassel\, JCCSF Public Programs Manager at lkassel@jccsf.org.\nWhat to Ex
 pect\nShabbat rituals to welcome the evening\nFeatured performances and a 
 community open mic\nNosh and drinks\nSpace to gather and connect\nAll are 
 welcome (21+)....\n\n$10\, 21+\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/202
 6/10/16/here-ish-queer-ish-stories-of-queer-jewish-california-tickets\nSou
 rce: DoTheBay
GEO:37.787374;-122.4473551
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34725287/3ead7d98-beb2-4c08-831e-a1f7c013d17b.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Jewish Community Center of San Francisco\, 3200 California Street
 \, San Francisco\, CA\, 94118
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/16/here-ish-queer-ish-stories-of-q
 ueer-jewish-california-tickets
END:VEVENT
