UID:funcheap-1358517@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:Gareth Gooch courtesy of Bearrison Street Fair\nThe Sisters of
  Perpetual Indulgence and the Bears of San Francisco invite you to celebra
 te “A Fair For Every Bear” on Saturday\, October 17\, 2026! We’re br
 inging back favorites including the Deadlift Contest\, Full Queer Wrestlin
 g\, and XL Art Gallery\, plus plenty of new attractions.\nSet in San Franc
 isco’s Leather and LGBTQ Cultural District in SoMa\, Bearrison Street Fa
 ir is an inclusive event for adult members of the LGBTQ+ community\, promo
 ting body positivity and cultural diversity while fostering a supportive a
 nd welcoming bear scene.\nEnjoy burly entertainment\, including attendee c
 ompetitions\, queer wrestling\, art\, a mechanical bull\, cabaret performa
 nces and more.\n\nEnjoy burly entertainment\, including attendee competiti
 ons\, building off the fan-favorite wrestling stage and the buns-out deadl
 ift competition.\nBearrison Street Fair 2026\nSaturday\, October 17\, 2026
  | Noon to 6pm\nHarrison and 11th St.\, SOMA\, San Francisco\nFREE\nFull Q
 ueer Wrestling\nWe’re thrilled to have Full Queer Wrestling back at Bear
 rison for 2026! Catch the action throughout the afternoon.\n2026 Schedule:
  12–1PM\, 2–3PM\, 4–5PM\nBarbells\, Bears & Butts Deadlift Competiti
 on\nGet ready for one of Bearrison’s signature spectacles as the Barbell
 s\, Bears & Butts Deadlift Competition returns. The competition welcomes a
 ll genders and body types\, with competitors choosing between 135\, 225\, 
 or 315 pounds depending on their strength and experience.\nRound 1 feature
 s the 135- and 2...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.bearrison.org/\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-inaugural-bearrison-street-fair-soma/\nSour
 ce: Funcheap SF
