DESCRIPTION:Join us every Thursday night for a vibrant Bachata\nexperience
 . Whether you're brand new or a seasoned dancer\, our welcoming\natmospher
 e is the perfect place to learn\, connect\, and have fun.\n\n7:00-8:00 PM 
 - Bachata lessons. Mixed level\; beginners\nwelcome and no partner needed.
 \n8:00-11:00 PM - Social dancing with top DJs spinning the\nhottest Bachat
 a hits.\n\nEnjoy a night of great music\, community\, and movement - plus\
 ndelicious food\, craft cocktails\, wine\, beer\, and fine cigars availabl
 e for\npurchase.\n\nPricing:\nAdvance registration: $8.\n\nWalk-ins at the
  door: $10.\n\nWe recommend registering online to reserve your spot. Come\
 nearly\, grab a bite\, and make a night of it.\n\nInessence Dance Company 
 directors Bryon Stroud and Sammantha\nArias first joined forces in 2012. T
 heir once-small group of local Bachata\ndancers has expanded into an organ
 ization of more than 100 dancers across the\nBay Area and Sacramento.\n\nS
 tudents find their classes helpful for learning material\nthey can use on 
 the social dance floor. All levels are welcome\, and partners\nare not req
 uired.\n\nNO REFUNDS - Must be 21+\n\n$8 online\, $10 at the door\nCigar B
 ar & Grill PRESENTS:\n\nTickets: https://www.cigarbarandgrill.com/index.ph
 p/entertainment\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/22/bachata-p
 arty-with-inessence-dance-co-thursday-october-22-2026-tickets\nSource: DoT
