BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Official San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17905397@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:There is a particular electricity that only San Francisco can 
 conjure on the Friday before Halloween—when the city itself seems to lea
 n into the night with a conspiratorial grin. On October 30 the San Francis
 co Halloween Pub Crawl returns for its second day of a four-day odyssey th
 at began October 24 and will crest through October 31 and November 1. This
  is the evening when costumes grow bolder\, laughter grows louder\, and th
 e streets between Polk and the surrounding neighborhoods become a moving s
 tage of pure seasonal joy.\n\nArrive at Mayes Oyster House by 6 PM and fee
 l the collective anticipation rise like fog off the bay. Your ticket unloc
 ks free entry to an exclusive circuit of the city’s most charismatic bar
 s: the romantic flicker of Beso Mae\, the storybook quirk of White Rabbit\
 , the sleek confidence of Silver Cloud\, the vibrant pulse of Hanaro\, the
  cool radiance of The Blue Light\, the social swirl of Jaxson\, the high-e
 nergy floor of Decodance\, the musical heartbeat of Music City Starfactory
 \, the flavorful spirit of Sacred Taco\, the stellar vibe of Comet Club\, 
 the friendly clink of glasses at Union Street Ale House\, the adventure-re
 ady atmosphere of Route 101\, the stylish allure of El Lopo\, the playful 
 dual personality of Rick & Roxy’s\, the timeless charm of Rockwell\, the
  storied character of McTeague’s Saloon\, the contemporary cool of Westw
 ood\, the plush refuge of Lush Lounge\, the neighborhood warmth of R Bar\,
  the comforting slices at Uni Pizza\, the spellbinding fun of Wi...\n\n$12
  to $45\, 21 and over\nCrawlSF Presents:\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.
 io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fthe-official-san-franci
 sco-halloween-pub-crawl-tickets-1983732312748\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/10/30/the-official-san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl-ticket
 s\nSource: DoTheBay
