BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl: Crawloween
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17764847@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:DJ/Parties
DESCRIPTION:By midafternoon on Halloween\, San Francisco will already be f
 illing with superheroes\, movie characters\, monsters and groups dressed i
 n matching costumes. Many of them will be heading to Crawloween\, the mass
 ive San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl taking place from 2PM to 10PM on Sat
 urday\, October 31\, 2026. More than 20\,000 participants are expected to 
 join the main day of this four-part Halloween event.\n\nCrawloween is buil
 t for people who want choices. The route includes more than 50 bars spread
  through the Marina\, Russian Hill\, Polk Gulch\, Union Square and other p
 arts of the city. Participants are not locked into one venue or one schedu
 le. After checking in\, they can choose their own stops\, meet up with fri
 ends in different neighborhoods and spend the day moving between casual ba
 rs\, dance venues\, restaurants and Halloween-themed locations.\n\nThe lon
 g event schedule makes it possible to start early and enjoy the celebratio
 n at a comfortable pace. Guests can arrive in the afternoon\, visit a few 
 bars\, stop for food and then head toward the busiest parts of the route a
 s Halloween night gets underway. Discounted drink specials at participatin
 g locations can help make a long day out more affordable\, while free entr
 y at crawl bars means groups can keep moving without paying separate cover
  charges at every stop.\n\nTransportation between event areas is easier th
 anks to the free Pub Crawl Party Bus. The Saturday shuttle connects key pa
 rts of the route and gives participants a chance to see...\n\n$12 to $55\,
  21+ Event\nCrawlSF Presents:\n\nTickets: https://crawlsf.com/events/crawl
 oween-san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl-2/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/
 events/2026/10/31/san-francisco-halloween-pub-crawl-crawloween-tickets\nSo
 urce: DoTheBay
