  – $1 drinks during ’60s hour\, $2 drinks during ’70s hour\, and so 
 on.\nThere’s a live DJ\, two rooms and an outdoor patio.\n\nBattle Of Th
 e Decades\nEvery Friday | 5 pm ’til late\nMonroe\, 473 Broadway St. (@ K
 earny)\, SF\n>> FREE with RSVP on Eventbrite\nThe earlier you get there\, 
 the cheaper the drinks. Drinks typically included in happy hour pricing ar
