DESCRIPTION:Disco never left. Neither did great wine. VOON 54: Studio 54 g
 lamour meets harvest season\, one unforgettable night at W San Francisco.\
 n\nVOON 54:\nA Studio 54 Harvest Party with VOON Wines\nStep into the disc
 o. VOON Wines invites you to VOON 54\, a night of glitter\, groove\, and g
 reat wine\, celebrating this year's harvest in true Studio 54 fashion.\nHo
 sted in partnership with W San Francisco\, VOON 54 brings together our com
 munity for an evening of dancing\, DJ sets\, live music\, and pours from o
 ur latest harvest. Expect velvet disco vibes a dance floor that doesn't qu
 it\, all wrapped in the glamour of one of the most iconic nightlife eras.\
 nCome dressed to dazzle. Sequins\, silk\, gold\, and glam are all welcome 
 (and encouraged).\n\nEVENT DETAILS\n\nSaturday\, November 7th\n7:00 PM –
  11:00 PM (The Living Room bar at W will be open after)\nW San Francisco 
 — 181 3rd Street\, SOMA\n$18 per ticket (entry only — wine available f
 or purchase on-site)\n21+ event\, valid ID required\nFeaturing VOON Wines'
  latest harvest\nLive music + DJs all night\nStudio 54 dress code encourag
 ed\nVIP guest room rates at W San Francisco for those staying the night\n\
 nJoin us to toast the season\, the community\, and the vines that made it 
 all possible.\n\nGrab your tickets now — VOON 54 will sell out.\n\nLearn
  more about VOON Wines and order your new favorites at voonwines.com\n\n$1
 8 Entry\, Ages 21+\nVOON Wines\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?
 u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fvoon-54-a-studio-54-harvest-party
 -with-voon-wines-tickets-2000671836319\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/even
 ts/2026/11/7/voon-54-a-studio-54-harvest-party-with-voon-wines-tickets\nSo
 urce: DoTheBay
