LOCATION:San Francisco AIDS Foundation\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/19/el-grupo-de-apoyo-latino-ticket
 s
END:VEVENT
