 lebrates their work with a healthy dose of competition as fans go head-to-
 head on the dance floor to the music of these two cultural icons.\nThe par
 ty starts at 9 pm with a $10 cover\, and will feature dancing to DJ album 
 cuts\, remixes\, rare tracks\, and classics of the two artists’ greatest
  hits. So sharpen your splits and tighten up your toe stands for a night f
 ull of moonwalking at the Madrone\, and make sure to “Don’t Stop ‘Ti
 l You Get Enough.”\n\nUpcoming SF’s Prince vs. Michael Jackson DJ Part
 y (NoPa) Events\nSat 11/7 SF’s Prince vs. Michael Jackson DJ Party (NoPa
